{"version":1,"breite":1080,"hoehe":1920,"texte":[{"text":"Zivilprozessrecht","box":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":322.5,"h":62.8},"innen":{"x":40,"y":16,"w":236.5,"h":30.8},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":28,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":30.8,"lsp":0.6,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":322.5,"h":62.8},"farbe":"rgb(8, 25, 65)","radius":0},"hinter":"rgb(56, 143, 234)"},{"text":"Typischer Fehler","box":{"x":194,"y":322.5,"w":245.1,"h":39},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":32,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(8, 25, 65)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":null,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":84,"y":300,"w":381.1,"h":84},"farbe":"rgb(203, 222, 250)","radius":40},"hinter":"rgb(56, 143, 234)"},{"text":"Falsche Partei verklagt: Rubrum berichtigen oder Parteiwechsel?","box":{"x":84,"y":410,"w":912,"h":303.4},"innen":{"x":121,"y":428.5,"w":838,"h":266.4},"schrift":"Space Grotesk","groesse":74,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":88.8,"lsp":-0.7,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":84,"y":410,"w":912,"h":303.4},"farbe":"rgb(8, 25, 65)","radius":48},"hinter":"rgb(56, 143, 234)"},{"text":"Falsch","box":{"x":132,"y":813.4,"w":816,"h":66},"schrift":"Space Grotesk","groesse":60,"gewicht":"400","farbe":"rgb(179, 38, 30)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":66,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":84,"y":769.4,"w":912,"h":282.4},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(56, 143, 234)"},{"text":"Die falsche Person wurde verklagt – also wird einfach das Rubrum berichtigt.","box":{"x":132,"y":901.4,"w":816,"h":106.4},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":38,"gewicht":"400","farbe":"rgb(8, 25, 65)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":53.2,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":84,"y":769.4,"w":912,"h":282.4},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(56, 143, 234)"},{"text":"Richtig","box":{"x":132,"y":1151.8,"w":816,"h":66},"schrift":"Space Grotesk","groesse":60,"gewicht":"400","farbe":"rgb(11, 74, 51)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":66,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":84,"y":1107.8,"w":912,"h":654.7},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(56, 143, 234)"},{"text":"Berichtigt wird nur, wenn die gemeinte Partei feststand und bloß falsch bezeichnet war. Soll eine andere Person Partei werden, ist das ein Parteiwechsel: Die Rechtsprechung behandelt ihn wie eine Klageänderung (§§ 263 ff. ZPO) – Einwilligung oder Sachdienlichkeit; nach Beginn der mündlichen Verhandlung muss der alte Beklagte zustimmen (§ 269 Abs. 1 ZPO analog).","box":{"x":132,"y":1239.8,"w":816,"h":478.7},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":38,"gewicht":"400","farbe":"rgb(8, 25, 65)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":53.2,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":{"box":{"x":84,"y":1107.8,"w":912,"h":654.7},"farbe":"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92)","radius":30},"hinter":"rgb(56, 143, 234)"},{"text":"Zivilrecht","box":{"x":880.2,"y":1762.5,"w":115.8,"h":31},"schrift":"Inter","groesse":26,"gewicht":"700","farbe":"rgb(8, 25, 65)","ausrichtung":"start","zeilenhoehe":null,"lsp":0,"rotation":0,"pille":null,"hinter":"rgb(56, 143, 234)"}],"bilder":[],"quellSha256":"85bc9204fd5f9d68798fa85b029c68d8e47302691bbafcf4e97771fdc8e9b44b"}
